y come at around midnight. Very safe and welcoming place, many people go there before heading to nightclubs in the city. Al","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Poitiers"},{"id":"poitiers_wv_le_republic_corner","areaId":"poitiers","name":"Le Républic Corner","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":46.61338,"lng":0.34473},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"poitiers_wv_le_republic_corner","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://republic-corner.fr/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lerepubliccorner","poitiers"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"},{"open":"18:00","close":"23:59"}],"note":"Typical hours — check the official site"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"Un lieu pour partager un verre ou déguster une variété de plats des food trucks présents. L'atmosphère est accueillante, adaptée à tous les âges, avec un décor de style guinguette. Les samedis soir, un DJ anime les lieux. De plus, une carte de crédit interne simplifie les paiements","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"fr:Poitiers"},{"id":"poitiers_wv_l_est_ouest","areaId":"poitiers","name":"L'Est-Ouest","category":"nightlife","tags":["nightlife"],"location":{"lat":46.5808,"lng":0.33899},"visitMinutes":90,"photoSeed":"poitiers_wv_l_est_ouest","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["lestouestpoitiers","poitiers"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"20:00","close":"23:59"},null,null,null,null,null,null],"note":"Closed Tue, Wed, Thu, Fri, Sat, Sun"},"bestLight":"night","summary":"One of the most visited bars in the city center. Very busy at night especially at the end of the week (Thursday to Saturday). Because of its location and its popularity, it is considered to be a safe and welcoming place to hang out a night.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Poitiers"},{"id":"poitie